{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":120,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਸਹਾਇਤਾ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਪ੍ਰਾਰਥਨਾ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਆਪਣੀ ਬਿਪਤਾ ਦੇ ਦਿਨ ਮੈਂ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਨੂੰ ਪੁਕਾਰਿਆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਸਨੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਉੱਤਰ ਦਿੱਤਾ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ, ਮੇਰੀ ਜਾਨ ਨੂੰ ਝੂਠੇ ਬੁੱਲ੍ਹਾਂ ਤੋਂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਛਲੇਡੀ ਜੀਭ ਤੋਂ ਛੁਡਾ ਲੈ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਛਲੇਡੀਏ ਜੀਭੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੈਨੂੰ ਕੀ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਜਾਵੇ, ਅਤੇ ਹੋਰ ਤੇਰੇ ਲਈ ਕੀ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਵੇ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸੂਰਮੇ ਦੇ ਤਿੱਖੇ ਤੀਰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਝਾੜੀ ਦੇ ਅੰਗਿਆਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਉਹ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਸਜ਼ਾ ਦੇਵੇਗਾ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹਾਏ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਜੋ ਮੈਂ ਮੇਸ਼ੇਕ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਮੈਂ ਕੇਦਾਰ","poem":1},{"noteId":63},{"text":"ਦੇ ਡੇਰਿਆਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਵੱਸਦਾ ਹਾਂ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੀ ਜਾਨ ਨੂੰ ਮੇਲ ਦੇ ਵੈਰੀ ਨਾਲ ਬਹੁਤ ਸਮੇਂ ਤੱਕ ਵੱਸਣਾ ਪਿਆ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਮੇਲ ਚਾਹੁੰਦਾ ਹਾਂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰ ਜਦ ਮੈਂ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਉਹ ਲੜਾਈ ਚਾਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":63,"caller":"+","text":"ਦੂਰ ਅਤੇ ਅਲੱਗ ਦੇਸ ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਵਾਸੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਹੀ ਹਿੰਸਕ ਸਨ l","reference":{"chapter":120,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/120.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/121.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/119.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}